SF0086 Alternative teaching certificate.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Laursen, D, Brennan, McKeown and Smith, D
and Representative(s) Banks, Haroldson, Heiner,
Strock, Webber and Wharff
AN ACT relating to the certification of teachers; modifying the duties of the
professional teaching standards board; creating an alternative teacher
certificate for K-12 teachers; establishing requirements for alternative
certification; and providing for an effective date.
1/3/2025 Bill Number Assigned
